 "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499297336_1398957598042295_8658273739049393698_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k_Kzce50zGoQ7kNvwG0Q6KB&_nc_oc=AdpL2FTXyyjgWRGLJtGXurm7fidcwBYY1wmlA2eGM5-t8TvABKoQuNkxdflY8iWYkUY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQDHYRNdKRogKbla3zf_mkuWBM-i81oVf__0wfGpVDxaA&oe=6AFDCAEA"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShots-Oculus.png", "id": "586954080949358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300998_586954084282691_5915317232262222336_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zT5EfenKLRcQ7kNvwGfv9Hc&_nc_oc=Adq2Hfz69pitpkg988OrqcbcuFW_qsrUbnPN6R9ozeunG8QajiAuS-koWj2VFrGXnMA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSlPPz2a-l0JnZXccbh62VJSSCK-W6NA9yd7TR-bDOQog&oe=6AFDAEE8"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShots-Oculus_05_2560x1440.png", "id": "721637487343617", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303666_721637490676950_560727177409300794_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cxhCC2iMJYwQ7kNvwE4gxLC&_nc_oc=AdqE-LeW_mzf8WSICHXvkAU4_IVNVg4OWcGGA-6VuoPgJlnNk2dp3a20VXbVifqmHXo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRfWEVkqUw73KFh7SDsRIroyIJTQxc17SOF5E8uVXDCVA&oe=6AFDDB93"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VideoCoverImageIAIRoulette.png", "id": "742679311697699", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499626133_742679315031032_2747559378173517706_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7o8xiRhf1iIQ7kNvwFb8NHh&_nc_oc=AdopEM0UBd_AKi7-QdgpDfdHT6WpjFvzVRJfHSKDskhZ9_8QXIPGzNnrrnfA5a9DJ0k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRcxcA4cCqpdY8Rbp0RJ8xn3ShbgJyn-AxjSkCbVGhMlw&oe=6AFDDC58"}, "display_name": "IAI - FreeEdition", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience the beginning of I AI, a VR-only multiplayer puzzle game for two players. This version includes early game sections, introducing core mechanics, story, and cooperative gameplay\u2014plus the fully playable and replayable I AI Roulette mini-game.\n\nTo continue the story and access the full experience, purchase the full version. For the full version, please follow this link: https://www.meta.com/experiences/iai/24036573459287812/\n \n# IAI - ROULETTE\nEnjoy the different game modes! Take on the challenge against other players.\n\nTrailer: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zBUWUlrnlPg\n{1098247502503809}\n\n\n# MULTIPLAYER ONLY\nA cooperative experience built around two players\u2014where communication isn\u2019t optional, it\u2019s essential.\n{723622620299839}\n \n  \n# COOP PUZZLE DESIGN\nEach player experiences the world differently. No single perspective is enough to solve the game\u2019s challenges.\n{30752864537661937}\n \n \n# CROSS PLATFORM\nPlay together across PC VR and Meta Quest headsets.\n{1074700744256507}\n \n \n# NARRATIVE DRIVEN\nDiscover the story of the Dreamers through fragments of dialogue, environmental storytelling, and shared decisions.\n{1302372631527111}\n   \n  \n# FULL BODY EXPERIENCE\nSee your entire body\u2014not just your hands\u2014in VR, deepening the sense of presence and expression.\n{1810818042838837}\n", "short_description": "This version of I AI includes the first few sections of the full game, offering a complete introduction to the core mechanics, story, and cooperative gameplay.\nIt also contains the fully playable I AI Roulette mini game, designed for replayability and fun with your partner.\nTo continue the story, access later stages, and unlock the full experience, please purchase the full version of I AI. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://iai.sola-air.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sola K.K.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://iai.sola-air.com/",